OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry with variable cloud, allowing some
OL,7,Fgood spells of evening sunshine. The
OL,8,Fwinds will ease further, becoming
OL,9,Fgenerally light but remaining breezy
OL,10,Falong the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry but quite cloudy to start,
OL,13,Fbreaking up through the morning. Then
OL,14,Fa mixture of sunshine and outbreaks of
OL,15,Frain from mid-morning into the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Blustery winds developing.
OL,17,FVery warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
